  "deactivated_at": "2026-09-03T16:11:33.629113+00:00",
  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Atal Kisan Jyoti Yojana” launched by the Energy Department, Government of Madhya Pradesh, aims to provide concessional electricity to farmers through a flat rate power supply of ₹750/- per horsepower per year to metered agricultural pump consumers up to 10 horsepower.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The applicant must be a farmer.\n  - The applicant must be a permanent agricultural pump consumer.\n  - The applicant must have a metered connection.\n  - The applicant’s pump capacity should be up to 10 horsepower.\n\n<br>\n\n",
